<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n113940" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χῆτ-ος</span></b> , τό (only used
		in dat.), <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>want, lack,</i> c.
			gen. pers., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χήτεϊ τοιοῦδ᾽ ἀνδρός</span>
			<i>from need</i> of such a man, <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				6.463
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χήτεϊ τοιοῦδ᾽ υἷος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					19.324
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χήτει ἐνευναίων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					16.35
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χήτεϊ λαῶν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>h.Ap.</u>
					78
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χήτεϊ συμμάχων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					9.11
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χήτει πρίνης</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Eup.
					360
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χήτει οἰκείων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Phdr.</u>
					239d
				</span></i>
			 (referred to <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χῆτις</span> by <i><span class="en">
				Tim.
				<u>Lex.</u>
			</span></i>); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χ. γνησίου κάλλους</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ph.
					2.266
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀστῶν χ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Poll.
					2.166
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χ. [κόσμου], παραδείγματος,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Them.
				<u>Or.</u>
				24.306b
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				4.62d
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χ. χαλινοῦ καὶ ἡνιόχου</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Jul.
					<u>Or.</u>
					2.50b
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χήτεϊ . . νοήματος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Orph.
					<u>L.</u>
					76
				</span></i>
			. (Cogn. with <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χῆρος.</span>)</div>
